@startuml
title IntelliSolve - Activity Diagram
start
:Open IntelliSolve drawing canvas;
:Draw or annotate a mathematical / graphical problem;
:Select Run;
:Export canvas as PNG data URL;
:POST image and dict_of_vars to /calculate;
:Decode Base64 image payload;
:Open image using Pillow;
:Build Gemini prompt with assigned variables;
:Send prompt and image to Gemini model;
:Parse model response using ast.literal_eval;
if (Response parsed?) then (yes)
  :Normalize assign flag for each answer;
  :Return success payload with data;
  :Render expression and result on canvas;
else (no)
  :Use empty answer list;
  :Return response payload;
endif
stop
@enduml